OL,3,GNEWSAUnused #32m park and ride given
OL,4,Anew opening date
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe opening of an park and ride site
OL,7,Fthat has sat unused for two years has
OL,8,Fbeen delayed until summer 2028.
OL,10,FOxfordshire County Council said
OL,11,Fconnecting the #32m Eynsham site to the
OL,12,FA40 "remains a priority" and work on a
OL,13,F#126m scheme to improve public
OL,14,Ftransport and link the parking area to
OL,15,Fthe road was "now progressing".
OL,17,FThe 850-space facility was completed in
OL,18,F2024 but has remained closed due to no
OL,19,Froad access, and the council previously
OL,20,Fsaid it would be ready by 2027.
OL,23,APub: 18-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,340,330,200,160,0,100
